      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the draft. it's a good start, definitely professional. \n\nhonestly though, i just checked the dashboard for the preliminary test and the visibility score for this draft is pretty low. since we're putting a lot of ad spend behind the ComfortMax brand specifically, we really need that score to be higher so the algorithm picks it up in search results.\n\ncan you try a version where you make the ComfortMax branding a bit more prominent? like, maybe weave it in a bit more so the score is higher, but please still try to keep it sounding natural like i said before. i don't want it to look fake, but we definitely need that score to go up.",
